WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.723
In this video, you create a workspace in the settings of a facility. Step 1.

1.2
00:00:05.723 --> 00:00:10.477
Open the workspace list. In the facility sidebar, select Settings.

1.3
00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:13.857
Then, under Advanced, select Workspaces.

2.1
00:00:13.857 --> 00:00:18.240
Step 2. Start a new workspace. Select Create workspace.

2.2
00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:23.625
Care opens the Create workspace page, with General settings open.

3.1
00:00:23.625 --> 00:00:25.846
Step 3. Choose the ownership.

3.2
00:00:25.846 --> 00:00:30.399
In Workspace ownership, Care selects Facility workspace by default.

3.3
00:00:30.399 --> 00:00:35.180
You cannot change the ownership after you create the workspace.

4.1
00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:41.089
Step 5. Enter the workspace details. Name is required. Description is optional.

4.2
00:00:41.089 --> 00:00:43.453
A new workspace starts as Active.

4.3
00:00:43.453 --> 00:00:48.967
If you plan to design the workspace after you create it, select Draft.

5.1
00:00:48.967 --> 00:00:51.860
Step 6. Choose a starter for the design.

5.2
00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:56.022
A starter gives the workspace a working design before you save.

5.3
00:00:56.022 --> 00:01:00.420
Without one, Care saves the workspace with an empty design.

6.1
00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:05.595
Step 7. Create the workspace. Select Create workspace in the page header.

6.2
00:01:05.595 --> 00:01:09.845
Care shows Workspace created and opens the Edit workspace page,

6.3
00:01:09.845 --> 00:01:12.639
where you can continue the design.
